  "title": "鼻歌なんかやめろ  (Stop Humming at Breakfast)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kozue": "こずえ",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "mayumi": "真由美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The next morning, at the Muranishi family table, Toru's mother Kozue sighs about the economy while Toru hums happily. His daughter Mayumi greets everyone, Kozue scolds his humming, and Toru brags that things are looking up at work. Listen to the family breakfast table first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "不景気だなあ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "おはよう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "おはよう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "鼻歌なんかやめろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何でだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "仕事はちゃんとやってるのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もちろん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "営業トップの人と組むことになった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "上司から期待されてるんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "家族を満足させないとだめだぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かってるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "ほんとに大丈夫か？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At home, polite endings disappear completely. Let's look at how family members talk over breakfast.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "不景気だなあ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Times sure are hard.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "おはよう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Good morning.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "鼻歌なんかやめろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop that humming.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何でだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why, what is wrong with that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "仕事はちゃんとやってるのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you doing your job properly?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もちろん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Of course.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "営業トップの人と組むことになった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It has been decided I will team up with the top sales person.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "上司から期待されてるんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My boss has high hopes for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "家族を満足させないとだめだぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have got to keep your family satisfied.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かってるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''I know, I know.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "不景気だなあ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "おはよう。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "おはよう。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "鼻歌なんかやめろ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何でだよ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "仕事はちゃんとやってるのか？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もちろん。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "営業トップの人と組むことになった。",
      "gap": 0.5
